% backend: none
% expect-error: rangecheck
% Scenario: a shading pattern is out of range. A PatternType of 3 is
% refused by makepattern with rangecheck: only tiling (1) and shading
% (2) patterns exist.
<< /PatternType 3 /Shading << /ShadingType 2 >> >> [1 0 0 1 0 0] makepattern
